## Two different AIs

- **Phone secretary** (Twilio + Gemini Live): answers inbound calls if FIX does not pick up. Speaks English only. Files: `functions/voice_relay.js`, `functions/voice_facts.js`, `functions/index.js` (`aiVoiceRelay`, `aiVoiceTurn`, `getAiAnswerSettings`). Prompt/hangup changes are **server deploy**, no APK.
- **In-app assistant** (Purish / wake word): `lib/features/ai/assistant/*`. Do not mix this with the phone secretary.

Owner does **not** rewrite the phone secretary from the app. Coach chat was removed. Errors go to **Настройки → Ошибки секретаря** (`SecretaryLearnPage`); FIX copies the pack and sends it here so the agent can patch prompt/functions. Live prompt is **server-only**: `DEFAULT_VOICE_INSTRUCTIONS` + shop hours + calendar + service-area map. App greeting, collect checkboxes, `extraRules`, and `learnedRules` are **not** injected into Live.

## Secretary behavior (current, Aug 21 2026)

FIX liked the natural conversation (listen first, one short sentence, do not quiz). Problems that were over-corrected and then rolled back:

- Do **not** inject fake user turns (`steerCollectAfterTurn`) after every reply — that made her not listen.
- She must **not say bye / goodbye / see you** and must **not hang up**. The **caller** hangs up. `end_call` tool was removed from Gemini Live setup; hangup tools are ignored.
- Shop hours: **7:00 a.m. – 9:00 p.m.** America/Toronto, last start **7:00 p.m.** so the visit ends by 9. If the caller wants 6 a.m. or a start after 7 p.m., do not book it; say we don’t work then and offer a time that ends by 9. **Take orders every day**, including Saturday, Sunday, and holidays. Regular visits Mon–Fri; **Saturday (and Sunday/holiday visits) by agreement** if the 2-hour window is free. Never say we don’t accept orders on weekends or holidays. Calendar defaults were updated to 7–21; old 9–19 config is migrated on the server.
- After “I’ll pass this to the tech”, keep talking: ask if they have another appliance or anything else. Do not wrap up. The caller hangs up.
- Do not hang up the instant they give another repair address; keep talking.
- **Calendar:** each visit is **2 hours**, one job per window (`functions/schedule.js`). Secretary sees a live calendar brief. If 2:00 p.m. is taken, do **not** book it — offer another time the **same day** first. Server refuses busy slots on job create (`resolveJobSchedule`). SMS reschedule uses the same check (`visit_sms.js` `tryMoveVisit`).

Spoken first name (e.g. Amelia) must go on the **client card** (`fullName`), not only the job. Do not leave `Клиент` / `Клиент +1…`. Helpers: `usableClientName` / `isPlaceholderClientName` in `functions/voice_facts.js`, `applyPersonNameToClient` in `functions/index.js`. Opening a job or client card also copies a real name from the job onto a placeholder client.

Gemini Live: Twilio media stream `timeLimit` is 3600s (1 hour). Context compression starts at 32k tokens (keep 18k) so she does not freeze mid-word on a normal call. WebSocket still reconnects around 10 min (`goAway` + session resume). `aiVoiceRelay` is 2GiB; text-turn runtime is 512MiB.

Deploy secretary + SMS calendar: `firebase deploy --only functions:aiVoiceRelay,functions:aiVoiceTurn,functions:incomingCall,functions:dialAction,functions:incomingSms,functions:recordingComplete,functions:processCallRecording,functions:aiRelayComplete`

- Long Live calls: Twilio stream 1 hour; large Gemini context so a normal repair call does not compress mid-sentence.

## Lock screen

Do **not** set `android:showWhenLocked` / `turnScreenOn` on `MainActivity` in the manifest. Those flags are set in code **only** for `twilio_incoming_call`. `clearLockscreenFlags()` on pause/resume when there is no incoming Twilio call. Otherwise leaving the app forces another unlock.

## Alphabet index

`lib/shared/widgets/alphabet_index_bar.dart`: selected letter is larger and shifted into the list (away from the right-edge thumb). Parent `Stack` must use `clipBehavior: Clip.none`.

## Bell / notifications

App-bar bell: `lib/features/ai/assistant/review_bell_button.dart`. Tabs: Secretary / Calls / Jobs. Swipe left/right between tabs. Cards show date and time. Opening Secretary or Calls (seeing the tab) dismisses those items **only when the sheet is closed**, not when switching tabs. Jobs leave the bell only after confirm (`needsReview=false`) or delete. Phone tray notifications: FCM `notifyMaster` + `NotificationService`. Sound is chosen in Android app notification settings via **Настройки → Звук уведомлений**. Do not delete notification channels (that wipes the user's sound).

## Save button

Page **Save** is only the top-right app-bar control: a **green check logo** (`AppBarSaveButton`), not the word «Сохранить». Dim until there are changes, then a bright green circle with a white check. No bottom Save on settings/job/client pages. Dialogs may still have Save. Client card uses the same draft + leave-prompt as the job card.

## Address

`lib/widgets/smart_address_picker.dart` has a **Unit** field next to street. Persist via `ClientService.addressFields` / `Location.unit`.

## Catalog settings

Each catalog list (types, brands, statuses, sources) must **not** have a yellow plus in the app bar. Add items with the plus in the body.

## Watched email senders

**Настройки → Связь**: list of sender addresses (`watchedEmailSenders` on `settings/config`). Gmail ingest (`functions/email.js` `ingestParsed`) saves mail from those senders even if it is not a CRM reply. Every new inbox letter is scanned for appliance repair. If it looks like a repair request, the app **notifies** and offers to create a client card + visit (`emailOfferPending` on the message). It does **not** auto-create the job. Intake phrase still marks the letter as an offer. Deploy `functions:syncGmailInbox`.

## Basket / trash

Drawer **Корзина** is a 30-day recycle bin (`deletedAt` on jobs and clients). Restore or delete forever. Unscheduled jobs (no visit date) stay on the jobs list banner, not in trash. Left-menu bottom row: red **Корзина**, purple **Запчасти** (car icon → `PartsQueueScreen`), navy **Поиск** (`GlobalSearchOverlay`). All three are 72×72; Запчасти sits between basket and search, not in the 2-column grid.

## Booking SMS / email

`sendBookingIfNeeded` skips jobs with `needsReview === true`. The confirmation goes only after FIX taps **Проверено**. Email jobs (`source` / `sourceEmailId` / `sourceEmailFrom`) still get a **letter**. If a phone number exists, they **also get SMS** for the visit date and for date/time changes (`confirm_rescheduled`). Phone-only jobs get SMS. Hourly `sendVisitReminders` retries missed booking confirms and catch-up SMS for email jobs that never got a text. Deploy `onJobWritten`, `sendVisitReminders`.

A follow-up email from a client with an open job is parsed by Gemini and written onto that job (address, model, serial, job-site contact). It does **not** create a second job. Deploy `syncGmailInbox`, `incomingSms`.

